 "descricao": "Shiyaaka Shadow by Khadlaj Perfumes is a Oriental Spicy fragrance for men. This is a new fragrance. Shiyaaka Shadow was launched in 2025. Top notes are Grapefruit, Lavender and Pink Pepper; middle notes are Amber, Cedarwood and Cashmere Wood; base notes are Moss, Patchouli and Musk.\nUnleash the power of presence with Shiyaaka Shadow – Special Edition, a premium fragrance for men by Khadlaj Perfumes. Crafted for the modern gentleman, this scent is a bold expression of charisma, depth, and quiet strength.\nIt opens with a dynamic blend of Pink Pepper, Grapefruit, and Lavender, offering a fresh yet spicy introduction. The heart reveals warm and woody notes of Dry Amber, Cedarwood, and Cashmere Wood, evoking strength and sophistication. Finally, the base settles into a lasting impression of Musk, Patchouli, and Moss, delivering depth and masculine elegance.\nShiyaaka Shadow for Men is more than a fragrance—it's your personal signature. Perfect for evening wear or making a statement any time of day.",
